  "description": "The MITTE Urban offers you numerous possibilities to be perfectly equipped for the next ride, whether for everyday city traffic on your way to work or a leisure ride on the weekend! You spend several hours on your bike every week and therefore you need a reliable and robust bike that is also comfortable and easy to maintain. Commuting is your time off. We want this time to be recharging and the least stressful.\n\nChoose your features: fenders to protect you from dirt, internally geared to give you extra comfort, racks to carry your heavy bags and integrated lights to show you the way in the dark.\n\nCLASSIC AND TIMELESS\n\nThe classic and elegant design of the 8bar MITTE Urban is timeless, beautiful and strong at the same time. It comes in three different colours: matt black, matt polished raw or deep sea blue metallic. The frame is made of triple-butted 6066 aluminium and you get a lightweight aluminium fork with this bike.\n\nMADE FOR EVERYDAY\n\nThe riser handlebar offers you a great upright position and because of this, you got a great overview when riding your bike in the city. Because of adjustable dropouts, the 8bar MITTE Urban can be converted easily and the geometry of the bike changes accordingly to your individual needs. With the additional adventure aluminium fork, you can add wider tires and ride your ALLROAD bike in almost every terrain. The system allows you to configure the 8bar MITTE also as a singlespeed bike or with an internal gear hub.\n\nPOWER\n\nDisc brakes are the most effective brakes in any terrain. When roads get muddy and dirty your safety is guaranteed. Also, they do not wear off the rims of your bike and they have great endurance. Numerous mounting options on the frame make it easy to carry bottles or luggage with your bicycle – perfect for the daily commute or the next weekend trip. It is also possible to attach a luggage rack or fenders with ease: Well equipped for all conditions with the 8bar MITTE.",
